%% Related FRs: FR-11, FR-12, FR-13

stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> Initiated

    Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass and funds sufficient
    Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails or insufficient funds

    FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

    SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
    SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
    SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within 10 s timeout

    Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms (callback, retry or settlement)
    Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses, or reconciliation finds no payment

    Failed --> Refunded : hold released to wallet

    Completed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]

    note right of Unknown
        Never refunded automatically.
        Re-query 1, 5 and 15 min after timeout,
        each attempt recorded.
        Then waits for reconciliation.
    end note

    note right of SentToBiller
        10 s timeout for live billers.
        TopUpNet stays here after 'accepted'
        until callback or reconciliation (Q10).
    end note

    note left of Failed
        Hold released including the fee (Q13).
    end note

